Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:37:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: Localized panel blur and Glass dialog/window chrome
 from retro_ui_applied.

Dual Shade panels use BackgroundBlurDrawable when panel_blur is set; dialogs and focused freeform tasks honor dialog_/window_ keys so UI Style can theme Glass without fullscreen RRO blur.
